OL,3,GNEWSAConstruction firms urged to offer
OL,4,Amore apprenticeships
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmployers in the construction industry
OL,7,Fare being encouraged to take on more
OL,8,Fapprentices.
OL,10,FThe head of a non-profit agency that
OL,11,Fworks in the sector has said it is
OL,12,Fbecoming harder to find placements for
OL,13,Fyoung people in the building trade.
OL,15,FCharmaine Holland, who runs Co-Train, a
OL,16,Fflexi-employment agency in Reading,
OL,17,FBerkshire, registered with the
OL,18,FDepartment for Education (DfE), said
OL,19,F"increasing employer engagement" is key
OL,20,Fto boosting numbers.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
